# The repo is stored LF, but a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF to
# disk, and prettier is configured endOfLine: "lf" — so `format:check` failed on every
# text file locally while passing in CI, where the checkout is already LF. Pinning the
# working tree to LF here overrides core.autocrlf and makes the two agree everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
